            "content": "<p>Founder Sarah Peake leads a close-knit studio team of eight alongside Head of Design Sophy Toller, who has worked alongside Sarah since the early days. The studio takes on only a limited number of projects at a time, so that Sarah can remain closely involved in each, providing creative leadership and working closely with each client.</p>"
